  "body": "Hello lovely humans,\n\n[webdriverio](https://www.npmjs.com/package/webdriverio) just published its new version 4.2.11.\n\n<table>\n  <tr>\n    <th align=left>\n      State\n    </th>\n    <td>\n      Failing tests :rotating_light:\n    </td>\n  </tr>\n  <tr>\n    <th align=left>\n      Dependency\n    </td>\n    <td>\n      webdriverio\n    </td>\n  </tr>\n  <tr>\n    <th align=left>\n      New version\n    </td>\n    <td>\n      4.2.11\n    </td>\n  </tr>\n  <tr>\n    <th align=left>\n      Type\n    </td>\n    <td>\n      devDependency\n    </td>\n  </tr>\n</table>\n\n\nThis version is **covered** by your **current version range** and after updating it in your project **the build went from success to failure**.\n\nAs webdriverio is “only” a devDependency of this project it **might not break production or downstream projects**, but “only” your build or test tools – **preventing new deploys or publishes**.\n\nI recommend you give this issue a high priority. I’m sure you can resolve this :muscle:\n\nOf course this could just be a false positive, caused by a flaky test suite, or third parties that are currently broken or unavailable, but that would be another problem I’d recommend working on.\n\nDo you have any ideas how I could improve these pull requests? Did I report anything you think isn’t right?\nAre you unsure about how things are supposed to work?\n\nThere is a collection of [frequently asked questions](https://greenkeeper.io/faq.html) and while I’m just a bot, there is a group of people who are happy to teach me new things. [Let them know](https://github.com/greenkeeperio/greenkeeper/issues/new).\n\nGood luck with your project :sparkles:\n\nYou rock!\n\n:palm_tree:\n\n---\n\nThe new version differs by 27 commits .\n- [`3f07d0f`](https://github.com/webdriverio/webdriverio/commit/3f07d0f186ab15ff4d4c80efbae6a14e03812b1a) <code>v4.2.11</code>\n- [`f8ee037`](https://github.com/webdriverio/webdriverio/commit/f8ee037c193f82e5ffd97b5f71f3885241026a05) <code>bring back ejs template</code>\n- [`15560bf`](https://github.com/webdriverio/webdriverio/commit/15560bf9a727fa1bbe120ebb14c6824e7f342a98) <code>v4.2.10</code>\n- [`e579497`](https://github.com/webdriverio/webdriverio/commit/e57949744639877f20332d10ddd51ff9868f3df5) <code>updated changelog</code>\n- [`a163dd3`](https://github.com/webdriverio/webdriverio/commit/a163dd389bb3aa3fb84c7609c20fa1d48a0a41db) <code>keep command files to generate doc page</code>\n- [`f5c770e`](https://github.com/webdriverio/webdriverio/commit/f5c770eff13d715c0bdc4aa4575afadfc7a82f2d) <code>v4.2.9</code>\n- [`d4b576f`](https://github.com/webdriverio/webdriverio/commit/d4b576fa21395c6ad85ae99ddb003d168370afac) <code>Update contributors</code>\n- [`0f9cdd4`](https://github.com/webdriverio/webdriverio/commit/0f9cdd4572c8d01da8c23afd092ce1424f9edaa6) <code>minor last doc tweaks</code>\n- [`edb6cca`](https://github.com/webdriverio/webdriverio/commit/edb6cca113d7c7663e4911e3b789c2fc98566f20) <code>minor last doc tweaks</code>\n- [`969faf7`](https://github.com/webdriverio/webdriverio/commit/969faf76262863e35c06333ca305e46f2d57695e) <code>updated changelog</code>\n- [`efc95d5`](https://github.com/webdriverio/webdriverio/commit/efc95d53a327095015561db059c85e060598e6ba) <code>annotate addCommand method [ci skip]</code>\n- [`89c6867`](https://github.com/webdriverio/webdriverio/commit/89c68679580603fe7938e47c880812b2b314949f) <code>keep docs in npm package</code>\n- [`b755b83`](https://github.com/webdriverio/webdriverio/commit/b755b83095c3b703622845d97d9e16cad56524a0) <code>added additional services to cli tool</code>\n- [`acc7ba3`](https://github.com/webdriverio/webdriverio/commit/acc7ba3d85344792b889fe17579fbd8eae232ffc) <code>added concise reporter to the docs</code>\n- [`f6fa331`](https://github.com/webdriverio/webdriverio/commit/f6fa331eaf1a9018c402b06b3b27e0606b6930d7) <code>add video to debug docs page</code>\n\nThere are 27 commits in total. See the [full diff](https://github.com/webdriverio/webdriverio/compare/4147f8b01fec98e35d057b67ee88428c04e7e4d0...3f07d0f186ab15ff4d4c80efbae6a14e03812b1a).\n\n---\n\nThis pull request was created by [greenkeeper.io](https://greenkeeper.io/).\n\n<sub>Tired of seeing this sponsor message? :zap: `greenkeeper upgrade`</sub>\n",
